== Overview ==
'''Frost Toilet''' is a toilet that only appears at the [[North Pole]] [[Christmas Mode]], it doesn't have high health but is still hard to deal with since it has a strong ability.
== Appearance ==
The Frost Toilet looks like a normal toilet but it is frozen. It also has a different toilet model unlike the other toilets, being similar to Minigun Toilet.
== Waves ==
=== Christmas Mode ===
*Wave 7: x1

=== Endless Mode ===

* Wave 55: x35

== Abilities ==
*Freeze: Freezes a unit for 5 seconds. A frozen unit cannot be unstunned by healing units such as Medic Cameraman or Camera Repair Drone.
== Strategy ==
Since you cannot unstun the unit, try to kill it with a decent aoe unit. For example, [[Titan Cinemaman]] or [[Clock Spider]].

==Trivia==

*The Frost Toilet has the same model as the [[Small Toilet]] and the [[Toilet]], just being a bit larger than both.

